This license covers the Little Ripper source code in this repository.

Little Ripper drives several third-party tools that are not part of this
repository and carry their own licenses. Release builds bundle some of them;
others must be installed separately. See the "Third-party components" section
of README.md for details. In particular:

  - cd-paranoia (libcdio-paranoia) — GNU GPL
  - FLAC / metaflac — BSD (libFLAC) and GPL (the command-line tools)
  - Sparkle — MIT
  - MakeMKV — proprietary, installed separately by the user (not bundled)

Each is used as an independent program invoked at runtime; redistribute any
bundled binaries in accordance with their respective licenses.
